stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LookupCaller : call connected
    LookupCaller --> MainMenu : known customer with saved language and remember-language on - greet by name, ask purpose of call
    LookupCaller --> ChooseLanguage : unknown number, saved language reset, or remember-language off
    ChooseLanguage --> ChooseLanguage : no input - replay the language offers (max 2 more times)
    ChooseLanguage --> ChooseLanguage : not understood - say so and replay the offers
    ChooseLanguage --> Ended : still no input after 2 replays - thank caller
    ChooseLanguage --> MainMenu : known customer - aane / 1 Twi, ɛ̃ / 2 Ewe, yes / 3 English - saved only if remember-language on
    ChooseLanguage --> OfferRegistration : unknown number - language chosen
    OfferRegistration --> AskName : yes or press 1
    OfferRegistration --> Ended : no or press 2 - thank caller
    AskName --> ConfirmName : name heard
    ConfirmName --> MainMenu : yes - customer created, zero balance, language saved
    ConfirmName --> AskName : no
    MainMenu --> AnythingElse : balance, application status or repayment due - answer spoken
    MainMenu --> ApplyAmount : apply for loan
    MainMenu --> MainMenu : agent requested (key 8) - stage 2, now says coming soon
    MainMenu --> Ended : goodbye or press 0
    ApplyAmount --> ApplyTerm : valid amount - English words or digits then hash
    ApplyTerm --> ApplyConfirm : valid months
    ApplyConfirm --> AnythingElse : yes - application saved, reference read out
    ApplyConfirm --> MainMenu : no - cancelled
    AnythingElse --> MainMenu : yes
    AnythingElse --> Ended : no - thank caller
    MainMenu --> Ended : any step - 3 misunderstood answers in a row - explain and end call
    Ended --> [*]
